# DEPLOYMENT NOTES:
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════
#
# Untuk Vercel:
# 1. Set environment variable di Vercel dashboard
# 2. Atau gunakan .env.production file (tidak di-commit)
# 3. Format: VITE_API_URL=https://your-backend-url/api
